DEADWEIGHT / SHIFT 01

Built from the workflow and ideas in C Optimizer by Antoni Norman / Pingu.
https://github.com/pinguy1982

Adapted material: ECHOHULL's bitmap font, axis-separated wall collision and
dynamic SDL loading approach. nervk informed the first-person loop and
procedural game audio; VOIDRUNNER informed the layered musical approach.

